{"repositoryId":1241604955,"availability":"available","full":"IrbaazN/multi-agent-research-system","name":"multi-agent-research-system","description":"Multi-agent research system built with LangGraph. Searches the web (Tavily API), reads sources (BeautifulSoup), writes a cited report with Groq-hosted LLMs (gpt-oss-20b, gpt-oss-120b), and a critic model revises it until it passes. Streamlit app with citation auditing.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-17T15:42:51Z","updated":"2026-10-18T13:07:03Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://irbaaz-multi-agent-ai-research-system.streamlit.app","topics":["ai-agents","artificial-intelligence","beautifulsoup","citations","generative-ai","groq","langchain","langgraph","llm","multi-agent","multi-agent-system","python","research-assistant","streamlit","tavily","web-scraping"],"demo":"https://irbaaz-multi-agent-ai-research-system.streamlit.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:48.767Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:48.767Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:48.767Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T02:49:48.767Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["I built a LangGraph pipeline that turns any topic into a cited research report. It searches the web, reads the top sources, drafts a report, and then a separate critic model reviews the draft and sends it back for revision until it passes."],"features":["Writer–critic revision loop with a pass threshold","Automated citation audit on every draft","Prompt-injection guard: scraped text is treated as untrusted data","SSRF protection on scraping: blocks private and local addresses and re-validates every redirect","Background-thread execution so Streamlit reruns don't interrupt a run"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/IrbaazN/multi-agent-research-system/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9275471826a88ca9c9f23f757874d664c357b924afd906bc9e